  "text": "## Step 6: Final Balance Payment  \n### Payment Method Options  \n**1. Bank Transfer (Preferred)**\n- Customer provides receiving bank details\n- Transfer initiated immediately (if funds available)\n- Timeline: 1–2 business days (FPS)\n- Confirmation sent to customer  \n**2. Check**\n- Check issued in customer name\n- Mailed to registered address\n- Timeline: 3–5 business days\n- Tracking number provided  \n**3. Cash (Branch Only)**\n- Customer collects at branch\n- Teller issues cash receipt\n- Immediate payment\n- Limited to £5,000 (regulatory requirement for cash)\n- Larger amounts: Check or transfer recommended  \n**4. Hold for Customer Instruction**\n- Balance held in suspense account (maximum 6 months)\n- Customer instructed to provide payment details\n- Reminder sent at 3 months\n- Transferred to unclaimed money fund after 6 months",
